[0.6,"o","\r\n> aldus-palace@ demo /Users/zhu/R&D/Aldus-Palace\r\n> pnpm --filter @aldus-palace/core build && pnpm --filter @aldus-palace/example-capture-cli start\r\n\r\n\r\n> @aldus-palace/core@0.9.2 build /Users/zhu/R&D/Aldus-Palace/packages/core\r\n> tsc -p tsconfig.build.json\r\n\r\n\r\n> @aldus-palace/example-capture-cli@0.1.9 start /Users/zhu/R&D/Aldus-Palace/examples/capture-cli\r\n> tsx src/index.ts\r\n\r\n\r\n$ input  Ship the onboarding page next week\r\nCaptured · 1 commitment\r\n  commitment  Ship the onboarding page next week  ·  window 2026-09-19 → 2026-09-26\r\n\r\n$ input  I prefer simple tools\r\nCaptured · remembered 1\r\n  memory      Prefers simple products and interfaces; avoids complexity  ·  active\r\n\r\n$ input  Fix the notification bug tomorrow\r\nCaptured · 1 commitment\r\n  commitment  Fix the notification bug tomorrow  ·  window 2026-09-19 → 2026-09-20\r\n  ! Used 1 active memories as context\r\n\r\n$ input  Fix the notification bug tomorrow\r\nCaptured · 1 commitment\r\n  commitment  Fix the notification bug tomorrow  ·  window 2026-09-19 → 2026-09-20\r\n  ! Already tracked, so this repeat was skipped: Fix the notification bug tomorrow\r\n  ! Used 1 active memories as context\r\n\r\n$ input  下周把 onboarding 做完\r\n已记下 · 1 件要做\r\n  要做  下周把 onboarding 做完  ·  时间窗 2026-09-19 → 2026-09-26\r\n\r\n$ input  以后产品不要做太复杂，保持克制\r\n已记下 · 已记住 1 条\r\n  记忆      Prefers simple products and interfaces; avoids complexity  ·  已生效\r\n\r\n$ input  今晚先不做评审，改排到周五\r\n已记下 · 1 件要做\r\n  要做  推进：今晚先不做评审，改排到周五  ·  截止 2026-09-25\r\n  ! 已参考 1 条生效记忆（认知上下文）\r\n"]
